{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0a2","comment":"红方此时流行的下法为车一平二，小赵选择上边马，可能是为了避免走成流行的过河车阵式。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0i1","comment":"开局阶段，车的活动不易受到限制，因而它的活动方向也容易被人忽视，犯下不易察觉的错误。红方此时出横车并无理想的位置可占，效用显然不足。不如改走炮八平七，黑如马2进3，车九平八，车1平2，车一平二，红方双车同时开出，可成为一种较好的阵式。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i1f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b3","comment":"至此，红方布阵欠当，右车被封，黑方子力开扬，布局成功。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"进七兵威胁黑马，被黑补象后并无后续手段。似应改走兵九进一，以后车四进三较为工稳。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2b0","comment":"现在分析一下双方得失，红方走了九步，黑方也走了九步，还轮到黑方走棋，加上红方相三进一和兵五进一效用都不充分，所以形势显然对黑方有利。但黑方如何扩大优势呢？青年棋手李来群为我们作了精彩表演。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g9","comment":"好棋！目前黑7路卒是强点，平车后加强了这一点，可以强渡，实施突破。如改走车8平6邀兑，则车四进六，将5平6，炮七进四，黑无便宜。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2d2","comment":"如改走兵五进一，则卒7进1，相一进三，车7进5，黑优。又如改走车四进一，则炮7平8，黑亦被动。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"nex